  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hakili Matagi Immigration Support in the Pacific Phase II 2024-28</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;em&gt;Hakili Matagi &lt;/em&gt;Immigration Support in the Pacific 2024-2028, delivered by Immigration NZ, provides bilateral&#xa0;support to Pacific Immigration Agencies to build knowledge and skills in areas such as development and application of policy, profiling, intel led assessments, compliance, data capture and analysis.&#xa0; There are nine programme countries;&#xa0;the Cook Islands, Niue, Tokelau, Tonga, Samoa, Fiji, Kiribati, Tuvalu and Vanuatu.</narrative>
  </description>
